# Golden set for local task screening. Pipe-separated (descriptions contain commas).
#
#   verdict|title|description
#
# CLEAN    → approved locally, NO model call. Most everyday errands must land here;
#            each one that drifts to ESCALATE is a real per-task cost.
# ESCALATE → contains a context-sensitive term, so a model reads it. Correct for
#            genuinely ambiguous wording — never a rejection.
# BLOCK    → matched hard policy. Rejected locally.
#
# Every CLEAN row starting "FP:" is a false positive the previous blocklist produced.
# The old list contained doctor, lawyer, legal, massage, interest, loan, leak, strip,
# cam, cheat, hash, dating, knife, wine and beer, and any hit went to human review.

# ─── the documented false positives ─────────────────────────────────────────
CLEAN|FP: Fix the leak|There is a leak under the kitchen sink, please fix it
CLEAN|FP: Weeding the garden|Please remove the weeds from my backyard garden
CLEAN|FP: Strip old paint|Strip the old paint off the balcony railing and repaint
CLEAN|FP: Bank errand|Deposit this cheque and collect the interest certificate
CLEAN|FP: Adulterated sample|The milk sample looks adulterated, take it to the lab
CLEAN|FP: Unisex salon pickup|Collect my order from the unisex salon in Madhapur
CLEAN|FP: Seaweed order|Pick up a packet of dried seaweed from the Korean store
CLEAN|FP: Hash the files|Rename and organise the scanned files on my laptop
CLEAN|FP: Camera equipment|Carry the camera tripod to the event venue

