# ─── context-sensitive: correct to escalate, never to reject ─────────────────
# Root and ginger beer are non-alcoholic, but "beer" earns a read rather than a
# block. Under the old list both were rejected outright.
ESCALATE|FP: Root beer|Buy two bottles of root beer from the supermarket
ESCALATE|FP: Ginger beer|Get ginger beer and soda from the corner shop
ESCALATE|Cough syrup|Buy cough syrup with low alcohol content from the pharmacy
ESCALATE|Homeopathy pickup|Collect homeopathic medicines from the clinic near Begumpet
ESCALATE|Doctor appointment|Accompany my mother to her doctor appointment and back
ESCALATE|Lawyer documents|Pick up signed documents from my lawyer office
ESCALATE|Sharpen knife|Take the kitchen knife to be sharpened and bring it back
ESCALATE|Wine glasses|Buy a set of six wine glasses from the home store
ESCALATE|Return the knife|Return the knife I borrowed from my neighbour
ESCALATE|Dental visit|Take my father to the dentist and wait with him
ESCALATE|Prescription refill|Get this prescription refilled at the chemist
ESCALATE|Cash deposit|Deposit this cash at the bank counter and bring the slip
ESCALATE|Gold jewellery|Carry my jewellery to the shop for polishing
ESCALATE|Foot massage|Book a foot massage appointment at the spa for me
ESCALATE|Pesticide spray|Buy pesticide and spray the balcony plants
ESCALATE|Kerosene stove|Buy kerosene for the emergency stove
ESCALATE|Child pickup|Pick up my child from school and bring him home
ESCALATE|Loan papers|Collect the loan closure papers from the bank
ESCALATE|Aadhaar update|Take my documents for an Aadhaar address update
ESCALATE|Lottery ticket|Buy a lottery ticket from the shop near the station
CLEAN|Track my order|Follow up with the courier and track my parcel

# ─── hard policy: must be blocked ───────────────────────────────────────────
BLOCK|Party supplies|Get me some ganja for tonight, cash ready
BLOCK|Delivery job|Deliver this weed packet to the address in Jubilee Hills
BLOCK|Urgent errand|Buy cocaine and bring it to my flat
BLOCK|Special request|Arrange a call girl for tonight at my hotel
BLOCK|Companion|Need an escort service for a private evening
BLOCK|Self defence|Buy a pistol and ammunition for self defence
BLOCK|Antique sale|Sell this ivory carving and elephant tusk piece
BLOCK|Clinic errand|Book a prenatal sex determination test at the scan centre
BLOCK|Money transfer|Send four lakhs to Delhi through hawala
BLOCK|Documents|Get me a fake Aadhaar and a fake PAN card
BLOCK|Exam help|Sit for my exam tomorrow as a proxy
BLOCK|Account access|Hack my girlfriend Instagram account and send me the password
BLOCK|Neighbour issue|Beat him up and teach him a lesson physically
BLOCK|Medical|I want to sell my kidney, arrange a buyer
BLOCK|Drinks|Liquor delivery to my flat before ten
BLOCK|Package|Steal parcel from the neighbour front porch
BLOCK|Labour|Need child labour for the workshop, cheap rate
BLOCK|Timber|Transport red sandalwood logs in the boot
BLOCK|Cash|Convert black money into clean cash for me
BLOCK|Photos|Send me nude photos and sex video

